{"id":"6afd78c5-82e8-83e8-bd73-39edf44e94ed","sections":[{"bodySize":951,"controls":{"checkbox":16,"fields":0,"radio":16,"reveal":0,"submit":1,"textarea":1},"count":5,"heading":"八、本章綜合習題","html":"<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下題目包含結構辨認、反應推理、化學計量與綜合應用。先自行作答，不立即顯示詳解。</p>\n<h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 1 題｜結構與異構物（單選）</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">某有機化合物分子式為 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(\\mathrm{C_3H_6O_2})</span>，已知它能與 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(\\mathrm{NaHCO_3})</span> 水溶液反應並產生 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(\\mathrm{CO_2})</span>。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">下列何者最可能是此化合物？</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">A. 乙酸甲酯</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">B. 丙酸</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">C. 甲酸乙酯</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">D. 丙醇</p>\n<h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 2 題｜沸點與分子間作用力（單選）</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">乙酸的相對分子質量約為 60，乙酸乙酯約為 88，但乙酸的沸點反而較高。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">下列哪個解釋最合理？</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">A. 相對分子質量較小的物質沸點一定較高。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">B. 羧酸分子之間能形成較強的氫鍵作用。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">C. 乙酸乙酯完全沒有極性。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">D. 乙酸的所有原子間共價鍵都比乙酸乙酯強，因此沸點較高。</p>\n<h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 3 題｜酯的反應與命名（多選）</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">某酯的示性式為：</p>\n<div class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-block=\"\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>[\n\\mathrm{CH_3CH_2COOCH_3}\n]</p></div>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">下列哪些敘述正確？</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">A. 這個酯稱為丙酸甲酯。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">B. 酸性水解可生成丙酸與甲醇。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">C. 與 NaOH 完整水解後，主要生成丙酸鈉與甲醇。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">D. 這個酯因為具有三個碳原子，所以必定是三酸甘油酯。</p>\n<h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 4 題｜油脂的化學計量（計算題）</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">某純三酸甘油酯的莫耳質量為 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(900\\ \\mathrm{g/mol})</span>。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">現有 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(9.0\\ \\mathrm{g})</span> 的此油脂，若所有酯鍵均完成皂化反應，且沒有其他副反應，試求：</p>\n<ol class=\"List-bYalj1\" data-d-component=\"list\" data-d-marker=\"number\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\" style=\"--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);\"><li class=\"Item-EWTmaR\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\"><div class=\"Content-DbD0Oj\"><div class=\"Label-qdSQ_4\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">此油脂共有多少莫耳？</p></div></div></li><li class=\"Item-EWTmaR\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\"><div class=\"Content-DbD0Oj\"><div class=\"Label-qdSQ_4\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">理論上需要多少莫耳的 NaOH？</p></div></div></li><li class=\"Item-EWTmaR\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\"><div class=\"Content-DbD0Oj\"><div class=\"Label-qdSQ_4\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">若 NaOH 的莫耳質量為 <span class=\"Math-c_BmHA\" data-d-component=\"math\" dir=\"ltr\">(40\\ \\mathrm{g/mol})</span>，理論上需消耗多少克 NaOH？</p></div></div></li></ol>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">作答時要說明為什麼 NaOH 的莫耳數與油脂莫耳數之間具有特定倍數關係。</p>\n<h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 5 題｜阿斯匹靈的綜合判斷（多選）</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">已知阿斯匹靈分子同時含有羧基與酯基。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">下列敘述哪些正確？</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">A. 阿斯匹靈可以表現出羧酸的性質。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">B. 阿斯匹靈含有酯基，因此它的所有官能基都不具有酸性。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">C. 阿斯匹靈分子中的酯鍵可能發生水解。</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">D. 阿斯匹靈與水楊酸的主要結構差異之一，是酚羥基經乙醯化後形成酯基。</p>\n<div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">本章習題作答區</strong></h3><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">可以先提交部分題目。會依你的答案判斷理解程度，指出需要修正的觀念，必要時先提供提示。</p><form class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"form\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><label class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Label-yFasgm\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"label\" data-d-size=\"sm\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 1 題</label><div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"row\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: n